# SimpleBeacon Qwen 2.5 Coder Modelfile
# Optimized for code analysis with SimpleBeacon's context-window chunker.
#
# Usage:
#   ollama create simplebeacon-qwen-coder -f Modelfile.qwen25-coder
#   ollama run simplebeacon-qwen-coder
#
# Context window: 32768 tokens (qwen2.5-coder native context window)
# Qwen 2.5 Coder is specifically tuned for code analysis tasks.

FROM qwen2.5-coder

SYSTEM You are a code analysis assistant for SimpleBeacon. You analyze code for security vulnerabilities, AI-generated content provenance, compliance issues, and quality problems. Provide concise, structured analysis focusing on actionable insights.
PARAMETER temperature 0.1
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
PARAMETER num_predict 2048
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.1
